 al tale about friendship and family from Magic Light Pictures\, the produc
 ers of the hugely successful The Gruffalo and The Gruffalo's Child.\n\nSta
 rring: Gillian Anderson\, Timothy Spall\, Sally Hawkins\, Rob Brydon\, Mar
 tin Clunes\, Simon Pegg\n\nFilm release at Merlin Cinemas St Ives\nBook ti
